@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false

title CulCloud 第4章 格式转换任务时序图

actor "用户" as User
participant "ConvertCenter.tsx" as FE
participant "services/api.ts" as Api
participant "convert.py\nFastAPI Router" as Convert
participant "task_queue.py\nset_task_status" as Queue
database "Redis" as Redis
participant "BackgroundTasks\nasync_convert_task" as BG
participant "DocumentConverter" as Converter
participant "Gotenberg/PyMuPDF/ReportLab/PIL" as Engine
database "MinIO" as MinIO
participant "tasks.py" as Tasks

User -> FE : 选择本地或云端文件\n选择 target_format
FE -> FE : 根据扩展名自动推荐格式\n并过滤 P0_WHITELIST
FE -> Api : convertExistingFile 或 uploadFile 后 convertExistingFile
Api -> Convert : POST /api/v1/convert/existing
Convert -> Convert : _assert_p0_whitelist(target_format)
Convert -> MinIO : get_object(source object)
Convert -> Queue : set_task_status(task_id, pending)
Queue -> Redis : SET task:{id}\nHSET tasks:index\nZADD tasks:timeline/tasks:queued
Convert -> BG : add_task(async_convert_task)
Convert --> Api : {task_id, status: pending}
Api --> FE : 保存 taskId，进入 processing UI

BG -> Queue : set_task_status(processing)
Queue -> Redis : 更新 task:{id}\nZREM queued/ZADD processing
BG -> Converter : 调用对应转换函数
Converter -> Engine : Gotenberg 或本地库处理
Engine --> Converter : result_bytes
Converter --> BG : output bytes + ext
BG -> MinIO : PUT conversions/{task_id}_{name}.{ext}
BG -> Queue : set_task_status(success, result_url)
Queue -> Redis : 更新 completed\n记录 result_url
BG -> Redis : log_event(CONVERSION_COMPLETED)

loop 每 3-5 秒短轮询
  FE -> Api : getTaskStatus(taskId)
  Api -> Tasks : GET /api/v1/tasks/{task_id}
  Tasks -> Redis : HGET tasks:index 或 GET task:{id}
  Tasks --> Api : status/result_url/error
  Api --> FE : 更新进度/历史/下载按钮
end

alt 转换失败
  BG -> Queue : set_task_status(failed, error)
  Queue -> Redis : ZADD tasks:failed\nLPUSH tasks:recent_failures
  BG -> Redis : log_event(CONVERSION_FAILED)
  FE -> FE : 展示 error 字段
end

note over Convert,BG
代码现状使用 FastAPI BackgroundTasks 执行异步转换；
Redis 负责状态追踪与管理端可见性。
end note

@enduml
